- Transcribe: time-coded captions and vocabulary controls
- Comprehend: topic extraction from captions
- S3 governance: encryption, access logs, lifecycle
- DynamoDB upsert pattern and id strategy
- IAM: least privilege across services
- Cost and retry strategies in a long-running workflow

